{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QvwbD8a5jZvmLLQDYqSGmA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:26.065994+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QvwbD8a5jZvmLLQDYqSGmA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/refEu2icj3f7v57CTPRX46MiaZSOAKpZfKDYyLdzzQtIcm0Slmo39U3TAXcqW2dy3OAYe5eicw0TkN9cnGNkibWfQg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>07/15</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>TRAVEL</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>07/17</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YkbQyYzoPsvpjPcdcpawg1XB6NHdyJ6t0Cl2Zo7iaIjAmJoBxoEWLh3dEattnCoicicdCBnxXMxnUk4aQGmFdkOHA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>为方便广大考生全面了解招生信息、科学规划备考路径，帮助考生全面了解我院历史文化、学科建设、师资力量、人才培养与学生就业等情况，搭建高校优秀本科生学术交流、研学互动平台，经研究决定，我院现举办“</span><strong><span>2026年优秀本科生夏令营</span></strong><span>”活动，热忱欢迎全国2027届优秀本科毕业生报名参加！</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.01</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>夏令营</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招生专业</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/woAoadEGNOotLdpuicd6L67PfWoK91vicKz139t6O7FSicd4Jyc986Tl9xeqLqHFFayyUQAkVgrrKwK3HOmmgv0BTduGQN3s3mTDNS1kuiaqmUg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.02</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>举办时间及方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>📅 时间：</span><span><span>2026年7月15日—17日</span></span><span><br/></span><span>💻 形式：线上会议</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.03</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>会议号后续发布</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/woAoadEGNOo7DmP2AzXfUHh83m4qWBEpurGQoJsbq0wY3sP6RMNPic9Nu7E8EP8OXCibwvXuE8mn8N1Ho7ibaNsEbuuM4maNnJDibbACibagHfnQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.04</span></strong></p><p><span><b><span>报名条件</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></p></li><li><p><span>高校本科三年级在校生（2027年7月毕业）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学习成绩优秀，综合素质高，具备良好的研究生培养潜质，学风端正；</span></p></li><li><p><span>无任何学术不端行为及任何违法违纪等处分记录；</span></p></li><li><p><span>专业知识综合应用能力强。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YkbQyYzoPsvpjPcdcpawg1XB6NHdyJ6t0Cl2Zo7iaIjAmJoBxoEWLh3dEattnCoicicdCBnxXMxnUk4aQGmFdkOHA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.05</span></strong></p><p><span><b><span>报名材料</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请人按系统提示</span></b></p><p><b><span>提交相应报名材料</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>本人身份证照片、证件照、学生证照片；</span></p></li><li><p><span>个人自述；</span></p></li><li><p><span>本科阶段成绩单（经教务处或院系盖章）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>本科阶段成绩排名证明（经教务处或院系盖章）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>外语水平证明（如大学英语四、六级成绩，德语专业四级成绩，或TOEFL、IELTS、GRE/GMAT成绩等）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>体现学习和工作能力的相关材料（如已公开发表的学术论文、出版物、各类获奖或资格证书）。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.06</span></strong></p><p><span><b><span>报名方式</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2026年7月1日-7月9日</span></span></strong><span><span>，申请人通过四川外国语大学研究生招生系统（</span><strong><span>https://yz.sisu.edu.cn</span></strong><span>，以下简称“川外研招系统”）报名，填写个人真实信息，并提交报名材料。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.07</span></strong></p><p><span><b><span>营员选拔</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span><span>我院对申请者提交的信息进行资格审查，根据实际报名情况最终确定入选营员人数。</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>成绩材料审核专家组根据营员报名材料中学习成绩、科研能力、获奖情况、外语水平等择优选拔，确定营员名单。</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>营员名单于7月10日在川外研招系统和我院官网（https://dyxy.sisu.edu.cn/）公布，未入选者不再另行通知。入选营员须在规定时间内登录系统确认是否参加，逾期未确认者视为放弃资格。</span></span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.08</span></strong></p><p><span><b><span>优秀营员评选</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>综合考核采取线上面试方式进行评定，综合考核满分值100分。面试教师侧重不同方面提问，与考生互动交流，教师现场给分，成绩取平均分。</span></p></li><li><p><span>按综合考核成绩由高至低择优评选优秀营员，优秀营员人数不超过营员总数50%，名单在川外研招系统中公布。优秀营员可获得优秀营员荣誉证书。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.09</span></strong></p><p><span><b><span>注意事项</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>申请人承诺填写的信息真实、准确、有效；</span></p></li><li><p><span>每位申请人只可报名一个招生学院，不得重复报名；</span></p></li><li><p><span>逾期未提交材料或材料不全者，视为报名无效；</span></p></li><li><p><span>此次夏令营不收取任何费用。</span></p></li><li><p><span>此次夏令营中考核活动与推免招生和统考招生考试不挂钩。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/woAoadEGNOo3ibW91kg8eAwmbQXJSFZqKm3bvgSV0GMNtlBGQMErCteWUvIwPgB8cgTYvwpricp0Xvjy1RC2dyWQXicPXj8CrEkF9CXS45bUBc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/woAoadEGNOrDNzebLiaVY2VwfGg2d6Yfkaiay2ZfGkgL2Qa9nCnN2FXHcy8u14X9WO0OdRYyGzml3qqcyFgwgiah952VbzP8FasIo3daibJiac28/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人：秦老师</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>联系电话：023-65385448</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/woAoadEGNOraRAYs7xcLASP7SxAwUPia2kcYgXA3PibRfPKRlHmQUkdwKfI4rYFlcSVjXBdXPTJ3IqswdCtlvWISOO4wzK5ZpAENAKeicb1TLk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e307d4288d34a78cffb5cf4f419ee78bbc4242612f0eaab9588438feecba4eb3","textLength":1155,"sourceSha256":"873362283b256e0cf39883b272ec7669870e5470244172d9f7358121923aaf2a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e0c87ad3f23fa7541fe2","title":"2026年四川外国语大学德语学院2026年优秀本科生夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:26.065994+00:00"}
